    relation: "packages/Webkul/Product/src/Helpers/Indexers/Price/Bundle.php:215 `$variant = $bundleOptionProduct->product;` inside `public function getOptionProductsPrices($option, $minPrice = true)` at :210 [shown def 210-235] - the sibling rule for the bundle kind, reached through the bundle-option rows rather than the variant collection; the record is bound to a local named `$variant` and its per-kind price indexer is nested in at :221-:225; the parameter this routine takes is untyped and its docblock at :206 names a DIFFERENT class (`@param ProductBundleOption $option`), so nothing in the signature or the docblock says a record is reached here at all"
